              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Dessert flavors divide opinion more than plain chocolate or vanilla. Buy the smallest tub or a sample pack first. Sweetness fatigue is common with cookies and cream, and a 5 lb tub you stop enjoying is the most expensive protein you can buy.
              </p>
